      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A10041006C0074006F00200061006800ED0021002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí, tú! ¡Para y admira lo que hay a tus pies!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED002C0020007400FA0021002000A1005000610072006100200079002000610064006D0069007200610020006C006F0020007100750065002000680061007900200061002000740075007300200070006900650073002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En diversos puntos de Ciudad Luminalia hay\ntapas de alcantarilla con diseños de Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "También se las conoce como \"Pokétapas\".\nTapas de alcantarilla, no de comer, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y esta es una de ellas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100590020006500730074006100200065007300200075006E006100200064006500200065006C006C00610073002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las tapas del Distrito Verde son de Gogoat.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610073002000740061007000610073002000640065006C00200044006900730074007200690074006F00200056006500720064006500200073006F006E00200064006500200047006F0067006F00610074002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y ahora, una pregunta para ti!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059002000610068006F00720061002C00200075006E0061002000700072006500670075006E0074006100200070006100720061002000740069002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué Pokémon aparece en las tapas del Distrito\nRojo? Muéstrame el Pokémon que creas que es<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla respuesta correcta.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ya sabes qué Pokémon figura en las tapas de\nalcantarilla del Distrito Rojo?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí, lo sé!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED002C0020006C006F0020007300E900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando sepas la respuesta, tráeme ese Pokémon\ny ven a hablar conmigo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0064006F0020007300650070006100730020006C00610020007200650073007000750065007300740061002C00200074007200E10065006D0065002000650073006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0079002000760065006E002000610020006800610062006C0061007200200063006F006E006D00690067006F002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues adelante, muéstramelo a ver si estás\nen lo cierto.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075006500730020006100640065006C0061006E00740065002C0020006D007500E90073007400720061006D0065006C006F002000610020007600650072002000730069002000650073007400E10073000A0065006E0020006C006F002000630069006500720074006F002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anda, no te hagas de rogar. ¡Muéstrame el\nPokémon correcto cuando lo encuentres!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me temo que es incorrecto.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006D006F002000710075006500200065007300200069006E0063006F00720072006500630074006F002E00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Pyroar macho... Caliente, caliente, ¡pero no!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020005000790072006F006100720020006D006100630068006F002E002E002E002000430061006C00690065006E00740065002C002000630061006C00690065006E00740065002C002000A1007000650072006F0020006E006F002100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Pyroar hembra...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
